        Software; or
    (b) any new file, or portion of a file, that contains any Covered
        Software.

1.10. "Mozilla"
    means the Mozilla Foundation.

1.11. "Mozilla Public License" or "MPL"
    means this License.

1.12. "Patent Claims" of a Contributor
    means any patent claim(s), including cost of defense, warranty
    disclaimers, and indemnifications, expressly assumed by a
    Contributor in a written agreement submitted to You.

1.13. "Source Code Form"
    means the form of the work preferred for making modifications.

1.14. "You" (or "Your")
    means an individual or a legal entity exercising rights under this
    License. For legal entities, "You" includes any other entity that
